      "max_ratio": 4.0,
      "pass": true,
      "note": "the conflict's row tables (factions with their feuds, sources, places) are held to the budget plus one step's changes whatever the faction count (A16): the host saves when every resident page is changed (Conflict::needs_save, PM-C10), so the saves a day grow with the factions instead (reported, saves_per_day). The phase 1 world under the camps is not paged here and is most of the heap, so the engine's own live bytes are reported apart (engine_live_bytes): about 580 bytes a faction stay resident by design (the wheel, parties in flight, the indexes: PM-C4, PM-C13)"
